"""Datasheet pin tables for every IC, diode, LED, photodiode, crystal and transistor on the SolarBand main board.

Transcribed from the cached datasheets in cache/datasheets/ and re-checked line by line against the extracted text
(2026-11-11). Page numbers are PDF page numbers (1-based) of the cached file named in `ds`.

Each pin: number -> (name, kicad_type, function).
 * name     = the datasheet pin name, ASCII-normalised: en-dash -> '-', overbar (active low) dropped exactly as the
              datasheet text renders it, whitespace inside a name removed ("Power Pad" -> "PowerPad",
              "Thermal Pad" -> "ThermalPad") because SKiDL splits pin look-ups on whitespace. Multi-function names
              are joined with '/' in the datasheet's own order.
 * kicad_type = KiCad electrical type used for ERC, from the datasheet I/O column.
 * Exposed pads that the datasheet does not number get the number the EasyEDA/KiCad footprint uses (pin count + 1),
   noted in `notes`.
"""
DS = "/path/to/SolarVest_work/wristband/cache/datasheets"

